  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        73.20639038085938,
        455.408447265625,
        87.62739562988281
      ],
      "text": "Recommendations 16–17: Algorithms to rule out TB disease prior to giving TPT",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        87.38239288330078,
        524.3917846679688,
        101.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "In 2011, WHO conducted a systematic review and IPD meta-analysis and recommended a symptom-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        101.38239288330078,
        527.4222412109375,
        115.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "screening rule of a combination of current cough, weight loss, night sweats and fever to exclude TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.38239288330078,
        527.4269409179688,
        129.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "disease in adults and adolescents  . The review showed that the rule had a sensitivity of 78.9%  (57)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.3824005126953,
        527.4189453125,
        143.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "(95% CI: 58.3%–90.9%), a specificity of 49.6% (95% CI: 29.2%–70.1%) and a negative predictive value",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        143.3824005126953,
        527.4398193359375,
        157.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "of 97.7% (95% CI: 97.4%–98.0%) at a TB prevalence of 5%. Most people living with HIV in studies",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.3824005126953,
        334.1511535644531,
        171.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "included in the systematic review were not receiving ART.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        185.3824005126953,
        527.3846435546875,
        199.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "During the 2018 update of the guidelines on TPT, a systematic review was undertaken to compare",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.3824005126953,
        527.4422607421875,
        213.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "the performance of the four symptom screen in people living with HIV who were and were not",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        213.3824005126953,
        527.4243774414062,
        227.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "receiving ART  . Data from 17 studies were included in this analysis. The pooled sensitivity of the  (58)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        227.3824005126953,
        527.3914794921875,
        241.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "four symptom screen for people living with HIV on ART was 51.0% (95% CI: 28.4–73.2), and the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        241.3824005126953,
        527.4178466796875,
        255.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "specificity was 70.7% (95% CI: 47.7–86.4); in people living with HIV who were not receiving ART the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.3824005126953,
        527.4057006835938,
        269.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "pooled sensitivity was 89.3% (95% CI: 82.6–93.6), and the specificity was 27.2% (95% CI: 17.3–40.0).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.38238525390625,
        527.4234619140625,
        283.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "Two studies provided data on the addition of abnormal chest radiographic findings to the screening",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        283.38238525390625,
        527.429931640625,
        297.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "rule for people living with HIV on ART  . The pooled sensitivity was higher (84.6%, 95%  (59, 60)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        297.38238525390625,
        527.4222412109375,
        311.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "CI: 69.7–92.9), but the specificity was lower (29.8%, 95% CI: 26.3–33.6) when compared with the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        311.38238525390625,
        180.1378936767578,
        325.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "symptom screen alone.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.3824157714844,
        527.4398803710938,
        353.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "In all studies, the median prevalence of TB among people living with HIV on ART was 1.5% (interquartile",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.3824157714844,
        527.4166259765625,
        367.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "range: 0.6–3.5%). At a 1% prevalence of TB, the negative predictive value of the symptom screening",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.3824157714844,
        527.4244384765625,
        381.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "rule was 99.3%; addition of abnormal chest radiographic findings increased the negative predictive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        381.3824157714844,
        527.4541625976562,
        395.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "value by 0.2%. No studies of the addition of chest radiography to the symptom rule for pregnant",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        395.3824157714844,
        225.80001831054688,
        409.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "women were found in the review.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        423.3824157714844,
        527.426513671875,
        437.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "During the development of the 2020 updated guidelines, the GDG agreed that in adults and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.3824157714844,
        527.4190673828125,
        451.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "adolescents living with HIV the four symptom screen – current cough, fever, weight loss or night",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.3824157714844,
        527.4234619140625,
        465.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "sweats – is very useful for ruling out TB disease, regardless of ART use. Confirmation of TB infection",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        465.3824157714844,
        527.4486694335938,
        479.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "would be desirable before starting TPT, although lack of access to TB infection testing should not be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        479.3824157714844,
        527.4122924804688,
        493.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "a barrier to TPT initiation. It noted the potential benefits of adding an abnormal chest radiographic",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.3824157714844,
        527.4266967773438,
        507.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "finding to the rule, while recognizing that the improvement in performance was marginal. Moreover,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.3824462890625,
        527.3958740234375,
        521.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "increased use of chest radiography would add more false-positive results to the screening rule,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.3824462890625,
        527.3946533203125,
        535.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "which would require more investigations for TB and other illnesses. Therefore, the GDG reiterated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        535.3824462890625,
        527.3848876953125,
        549.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "that chest radiography may be added as an additional investigation only if it does not pose a barrier",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        549.3824462890625,
        527.435546875,
        563.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "to the provision of preventive treatment for people living with HIV. It should not be a requirement for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.3824462890625,
        527.4168090820312,
        577.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "initiating preventive treatment. Although no study was found of the additive role of chest radiography",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.3823852539062,
        527.4255981445312,
        591.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "in testing pregnant women, the GDG noted that pregnant women living with HIV could also benefit,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.3823852539062,
        508.1150817871094,
        605.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "as long as good practices are observed to prevent harmful radiation exposure to the fetus  .  (61)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        619.2064208984375,
        376.8827209472656,
        633.6273803710938
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 18: IGRA and TST for testing for TB infection",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        633.3823852539062,
        527.40380859375,
        647.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "In 2011, WHO issued recommendations on the use of IGRAs for the diagnosis of TB infection,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        647.3823852539062,
        527.417724609375,
        661.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "including the blood-based QIAGEN QuantiFERON -TB Gold (QFT-G), QIAGEN QuantiFERON-TB  ®",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        661.3823852539062,
        527.4177856445312,
        675.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "Gold In-Tube (QFT-GIT) and Oxford Immunotec T-SPOT .TB (T-Spot)   assays. In 2018, WHO  (62) ®",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        675.3823852539062,
        527.4223022460938,
        689.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "updated the recommendations to stipulate that the TST or IGRAs (or both) can be used to test for TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        689.3823852539062,
        527.4178466796875,
        703.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "infection in LMICs. The recommendation on IGRA for use as a test for infection was first published in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        703.3823852539062,
        527.4431762695312,
        717.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "the 2018 WHO guidelines  . A previous systematic review was updated to compare the predictive  (63)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        717.3823852539062,
        527.3948364257812,
        731.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "performance of IGRA and TST for identifying incident TB disease in countries with a TB incidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        731.3823852539062,
        527.421630859375,
        745.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "> 100 per 100 000 population  . Only studies in which TST was compared with IGRA in the same  (64)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        745.3823852539062,
        527.4102783203125,
        759.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "population (“head-to-head” studies) were included. Relative risk ratios for TB for people who tested",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        759.3823852539062,
        413.3467102050781,
        773.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "positive and those who tested negative with TST and IGRA were estimated.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.8661003112793,
        801.2599487304688,
        51.10609817504883,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "24",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        801.2599487304688,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.4364013671875,
        801.2599487304688,
        170.0603790283203,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        170.06539916992188,
        801.2599487304688,
        364.234375,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis. Module 6: tuberculosis and comorbidities",
